// Cyrus limits: WARNINGS BEFORE YOU SPEND (owner rule 2026-10-12, D-62). The plan screen used to say "blocked" for
// things that are not hard boundaries (a lane that is only switched off, a request that implies heavy work). This
// module turns them into warnings with the likely consequence (lag / cost / time / what gets left out) and keeps the
// word "blocked" for the real boundaries only (plan tier = money, a game version where the API does not exist).
// Pure data + one function, so the plan sheet (components/cyrus/prompt/PlanSheet.tsx) and the Prompt Coach
